<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kian Joo 1996 net down 3.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kian Joo 1996 net down 3.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  68.52   vs	  71.28</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 59.1    vs	  61.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		   445.40   vs	 461.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    93.41   vs	  99.67</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  2.19   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    1.78   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Total Div (pct)	   40.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Kian Joo Can Factory Bhd makes tin cans and aluminium beverage cans among other businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
